*! cluster-sandwich (default), bootstrap & Pollard fixed-T SEs,
*! BIC group-number selection.
*! Ported from: BM (2015) Fortran/Stata/MATLAB replication code and the gretl
*! GFE package by Lucchetti, Pionati & Valentini.

